      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think `tcpci_tcpm_init` is the correct location. Right now, it\u0027s doing `tcpc_alert` and then setting up all the alert masks. Off the top of my head, I think it should mask all alerts, then clear ALERT, then set up all the other alerts masks, e.g. power status mask, then set the alert mask, then call `tcpc_alert` once all the masks are correct, then return.\n\nAlso, I don\u0027t think we should be doing this deferred. We want it to be done by the time `tcpm_init` finishes.\n\nSee my bug comment as well.",
